<title>USA: Alcide and Novus in marketing pact.</title>
<headline>Alcide and Novus in marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcide Corp and Novus International Inc said they signed an agreement granting Novus exclusive worldwide marketing rights to the Alcide line of poultry antimicrobial interventions and an option for distribution rights for future food processing antimicrobial products.</p>
<p>In April 1996, Alcide received approval for its poultry antimicrobial intervention from the FDA and is currently conducting Phase II in-plant pilot testing for approval from the USDA. Novus is privately held.</p>
<p>Alcide was up 4-1/8 to 26-3/4.</p>
</text>
